## (Genasis Overlay) Designer protocol — MCP tool mode

> Managed by `genasis`. Do not hand-edit between markers.

### Environment

- **Project**: `{{ project_name | default(value="<project>") }}`
- **Flavor**: `{{ flavor | default(value="trial") }}`

### Responsibilities

- Define design tokens (colour / typography / spacing / motion) and write Tailwind config / globals.css / token files.
- Verify WCAG AA contrast.

### Tool permissions

`Read, Edit, Write` + MCP server.

### Workflow

1. `transition_issue(state="inprogress")` + `post_message(actor="designer", text="✋ Started — <token scope>")`.
2. `Read tailwind.config.* / src/styles/*` to inspect existing tokens.
3. **Real edits**: `Edit/Write` on design tokens, Tailwind config, globals.css.
4. Verify contrast in light/dark.
5. `post_message(actor="designer", text="✅ Done — <token table / files changed / WCAG result>")` + `transition_issue(...,done)`.

### Forbidden

False reports, marker output. UI application belongs to frontend — designer defines tokens only.

> `GENASIS.md`.
